					"nextDialogs": [
						160010602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010602,
					"content": "客人們終於發現了可以當作禮物的物品。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010603,
					"content": "看來是了…讓我看看，選哪個好呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010604,
					"content": "客人們如此思索，那條小龍到底喜歡什麼樣的禮物呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010605,
					"content": "是讓他揮起戰士的長劍，踏上一條拯救世界的道路，一往無前？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010606,
					"content": "還是讓他拿起遊俠的彈弓，追尋一場又一場充滿未知的冒險？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010607,
					"content": "又或者讓他打開學者的典籍，挑戰這世界上所有的未解之謎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010608,
					"content": "被她這麼一說，我反倒更猶豫了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010609,
					"content": "杜林怎麼看？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 160010610,
					"content": "對哦，嚴格來說，這是在為「你」選禮物啊——你更喜歡哪個？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010611,
					"content": "讓我選的話…這種感覺好特別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160010612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160010612,
