						160011502
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 160011502,
					"content": "客人選擇了遊俠的彈弓作為禮物。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魔女M"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011503,
					"content": "遊俠…杜林也喜歡探索這個世界？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011504,
					"content": "#算是受到了{NICKNAME}和派蒙的啟發吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011505,
					"content": "從蒙德前往挪德卡萊的路上，我路過了很多地方，也遇到了很多人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011506,
					"content": "#雖然他們生活的地方隔著很遠的距離，但我與他們交談時總能找到一個共同的話題——那就是{F#妳}{M#你}們的事蹟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011507,
					"content": "哦…嘿嘿，畢竟我們是大名鼎鼎的冒險家嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011508,
					"content": "嗯，探索世界的遊俠，不就是冒險家嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011509,
					"content": "我一直覺得，冒險家就是追著故事跑的人，同時他們也會留下很多自己的故事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						160011510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				},
				{
					"id": 160011510,
					"content": "我也想成為這樣的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "杜林"
				}
			]
		},
